### 1. Register a New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin_user",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePassword123!",
    "first_name": "System",
    "last_name": "Admin"
}

### 2. Login (Get JWT Tokens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin_user",
    "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 3. Access Protected Profile (Requires Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create a Note (Requires Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Secret System Architecture",
    "content": "This note belongs strictly to admin_user."
}

### 5. Access Without Token (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Hacker attempt",
    "content": "Trying to bypass auth."
}